@archive 0003
@size 2

script 1 mmsf3 {
	msgOpen
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"하늘에 보이는 붉은 유성,\n메테오 G를\n다들 알고 있을 거다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"메테오 G는 평범한\n유성이 아니다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"거대한 노이즈의 집합체,\n이른바 “노이즈\n클러스터”다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Lee
	"노이즈…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"메테오 G가 행성에\n충돌한다면…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"모든 전파 기술이\n완전히 무용지물이 된다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Belle
	"그, 그럴 수가…"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = MrKing
	"하지만…\n나는 메테오 G를 통제할\n방법을 손에 넣었다!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"지구와의 충돌을 막을 수 있는\n능력을 가진 자는\n나 하나뿐이다."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"모두 이해했나?"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	"세계의 운명이\n내 손에 달려 있다!!"
	keyWaitClearMsg
	mugshotShow
		mugshot = Ice
	mugshotDisableTalking
	"..."
	keyWaitClearMsg
	end
}
